{#-
  हर हिंदी बाउंस स्वतः-उत्तर का साझा ढाँचा (PRD P1-2, WS-G).

  Structure, identical to the English layout:
    line 1            subject, from block `subject`
    line 2            the literal separator `---`
    everything after  the plain-text body

  Blocks a child must define: `subject`, `defect`, `remedy`.
  The Hindi here is written and reviewed by hand. It is never produced by the
  MT engine (app/stages/s6_translate.py) - a machine-translated apology is
  exactly the artefact nobody can be held to.
